This crate is an original implementation for nv-rs of the role kNVSE plays for mods (ADR-0016's
"later built-ins"; nv-rs#865). It contains no code of the plugin and no decompiled code of it, and
none was read for it: it is written from public behaviour and documentation only.

Plugin: kNVSE (DLL file name kNVSE.dll). Its public repository states no licence, so this crate
takes nothing but facts: command names, parameter lists and behaviour as the GECK Wiki pages of
the commands and of the plugin describe them (the owner's saved copies of 2026-11-21). No code or
example text of a page is copied. The pages state no licence of their own.

Where kNVSE changes the game's animation code, this crate does not copy the change: the engine's
translated Animation::StartGroup (004948c0) asks a seam of its own (ADR-0016's seams) and this
crate answers it from its override store. One file per step in `provenance/` names the pages it
was written from and what they leave open.
